Release:        %autorelease
Summary:        Reference and example networking plugins, maintained by the CNI team

# Generated by go-vendor-tools
License:        Apache-2.0 AND BSD-2-Clause AND BSD-3-Clause AND MIT AND MPL-2.0
URL:            %{gourl}
Source0:        %{gosource}
